.DS_Store

# Self-signed TLS keystore is generated at runtime in AndroidKeyStore; never commit key material
Android/src/app/src/main/res/raw/relais_keystore.p12
*.p12

# oh-my-claudecode local orchestration state (ephemeral; scattered through the tree by hooks)
# `.omc/*` rather than `.omc/`: a trailing-slash exclusion stops git descending into the directory,
# so a negation inside it cannot re-include anything. This shape lets `.omc/skills/` be tracked.
.omc/*
# Learned skills ARE worth keeping — they are hard-won, repo-specific findings, and were silently
# dropped from commits while the whole directory was ignored. Everything else under .omc/ (state,
# logs, notepad, plans, research) stays ephemeral.
!.omc/skills/
.gstack/
